  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ororeeria ronde rwa Aburaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu akanyuoma omokungu onde, ore korokwa Ketura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nere akamoiborera Simurani, na Yokisani, na Medani, na Midiani, na Isibaki, na Sua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yokisani akaibora Seba na Dedani. Na basinto ba Dedani nabwo aba: Ashurimu, na Letusi, na Leumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basinto ba Midiani nabwo aba: Efa, na Eferi, na Hanoki, na Abida, na Elidaa. Abwo bonsi nabwo baarenge abana ba Ketura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu akaa Isaka ebinto bionsi ebi abwate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abana b’abakuungu baria ba sere‐sere Aburaamu akabaa ebiegwa. Ekero are moyo, konya atarakwa, akabateebia barue ase omwana oye Isaka, bagende gochia moocha, ase ense ya Moocha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kwa Aburaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu nigo amenyete emiaka rigana erimo, na emerongo etano na ebere, na etano (175), ase obogima bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo asogetie omoyo ase obogotu n’obuya, ore omogaka, oisanekire nemiaka emenge; agasangerekana amo nabaanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka na Isumaeli bakamotindeka ase rikuruma agwo Makipela ase oboremo bwa Efuroni, omwana o Sohari, Omohiti, moocha ya Mamure,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ase oboremo boria Aburaamu agorete korwa ase Abahiti. Agwo nao Aburaamu atindegetwe ase Sara mokaye nere atindegetwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ogokwa kwa Aburaamu, Nyasae agasesenia Isaka, omwana oye. Na Isaka akamenya ang’e nensoko yaare korokwa Beeri‐Lahai‐Roi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ororeeria rwa Isumaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oro narwo ororeeria rwa Isumaeli, omwana o Aburaamu, oyo Hagari, omosomba o Sara, amoiborerete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amarieta ’abana ba Isumaeli, ase omooroberio bw’okoiborwa kwabo: Nebayoti, nere omwana oye omotangi, na Kedari, na Adibeeli, na Mibusamu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Misima, na Duma, na Masa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Hadadi, na Tema, na Yeturi, na Nafisi, na Kedema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nabwo abana ba Isumaeli, na aya naro amarieta abo ase emechie yabo na ebitwori biabo, na barabwo nigo baarenge abagaambi ikomi na babere, ase ebisaku biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isumaeli nigo aigetie emiaka rigana erimo, na emerongo etato, na etano na ebere (137), erio erio agakwa; agasangererekana amo nabaanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana ba Isumaeli nigo baamenyete bagachaakera Havila, bagaika Suri moocha ya Misiri, ase enchera ekogenda Asuri; bakamenya babebekaine n’abamwabo bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoiborwa gwa Esau na Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oro narwo ororeeria rwa Isaka, mosinto o Aburaamu. Aburaamu nere oiborete Isaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nigo areenge nemiaka emerongo ene ekero anyuomete Rebeka, omoiseke o Betueli, Omoaramu o Padan‐Aramu, omoiseke omwabo Labani, Omoaramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka agasabera mokaye ase Omonene, ekiagera nigo areenge omogomba. Omonene akaigwa ogosaba kwaye, na Rebeka mokaye akaba morito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana bakaba bakomigana enda yaye ime. Ere akabora: “Onye nabo iga, okoba moyo kwane ninki korangwenere?” Akagenda koboori’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akamoiraneria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Ebisaku bibere mbire enda yao ime,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "abanto babere orache koibora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na barabwo mbaatananekane korwa okoiborwa kwabo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "oyomo nabe ne chinguru kobua oria onde,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "oria omonene omosomba bw’oria omoke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero amatuko aye ay’okoibora achia goikerana, bakanyora ne chibarongo chiare enda yaye ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo bw’eritang’ani agasooka, ere nigo areenge omobariri, omobere bwonsi nigo orenge namarionya; bakamoroka Esau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega yaye oyomwabo agasooka, okoboko kwaye kobwatete egetingiro gia Esau na ere bakamoroka Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nigo areenge nemiaka emerongo etano nomo (60), ekero mokaye abaiborete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esau okoonia omwando oye bw’okoiborwa kw’obotangi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abana abwo bakinire, Esau akaba omotwari bwe ching’iti, korende Yakobo nigo areenge omonto omotoereru, ore kobeera ase chiema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nigo amwanchete Esau, ekiagera areenge komorentera chinyama chi’obotwari bwaye; korende Rebeka nigo amwanchete Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko erimo Yakobo naiyegete omosori gete. Esau agacha korwa orosana, konya orosire mono, ogoyire ase engencho y’enchara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Esau agasaba Yakobo: “Koranche, ong’e omosori oyio omobariri inywe, ekiagera n akuure enchara.” Ase ayio bakamoroka Edomu (engencho yaye, omobariri).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akamoiraneria: “Ritang’ani ng’oonerie omwando oo bw’okoiborwa kw’obotangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau agateeba: “Rora, inche nigo inde ang’e gokwa, omwando oyo bw’okoiborwa kw’obotangi inki orankonye?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akamoteebia: “Karatiana ritang’ani ase ’nde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esau agatiana, erio akaooneria Yakobo omwando oye bw’okoiborwa kw’obotangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yakobo akaa Esau omogati na omosori bwe ching’ende, na ere akaria na konywa; erio akaimoka akagenda. Naboigo Esau achayete omwando oye bw’okoiborwa kw’obotangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
